Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.22,0:00:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}网友想玩双人对战塔防。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.01,0:00:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}现在能玩了，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.28,0:00:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}而且还能打四对四。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.92,0:00:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}这条愿望拿到了十一票。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.48,0:00:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}要求很具体：定时赚钱，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.92,0:00:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}升级银行，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.11,0:00:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}派不同兵种，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.27,0:00:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}和朋友线上对决。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.89,0:00:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}我把它做成了虫潮围城里的虫潮对战。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.21,0:00:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}可以打一对一，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.22,0:00:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}也能选二对二、三对三、四对四。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.52,0:00:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}开局六百金，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.80,0:00:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}先花五百升级银行，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.60,0:00:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}手里就只剩一百。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.71,0:00:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}想马上出兵？
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.36,0:00:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}得等下一笔收入。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.85,0:00:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}银行每十秒给钱，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.65,0:00:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}升级后从六十涨到八十五。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.44,0:00:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}长远赚得更多，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.92,0:00:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}但对手不会等你慢慢发育。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.15,0:00:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}攒够钱，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.14,0:00:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}就派小虫群和机枪小队。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.03,0:00:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}它们沿选定路线前进，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.93,0:00:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}遇敌交战，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.08,0:00:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}目标是拆掉对方核心。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.42,0:00:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}自己也能跟着部队上前线，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.52,0:00:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}开枪、扔手雷。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.90,0:00:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}既要管钱，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.16,0:01:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}也要看住战场。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.52,0:01:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}多人对战每个人有独立的钱包和银行，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.86,0:01:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}还能给队友转两百金。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.91,0:01:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}这段四对四是我加七个电脑，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.63,0:01:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}真人联机最多支持八人。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.72,0:01:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(1430,775)}一对一打赢了电脑，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.18,0:01:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(1430,775)}另一场四对四却输了。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.30,0:01:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(1430,775)}十五分钟结束，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.80,0:01:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(1430,775)}我方核心剩百分之七十六，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.08,0:01:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(1430,775)}对面百分之九十一。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.88,0:01:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(1430,775)}出兵更多，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.00,0:01:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(1430,775)}不等于赢。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.13,0:01:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(1430,775)}接下来继续打磨对局节奏和兵种平衡。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.72,0:01:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}愿望单已经标成已实现、可试玩，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.93,0:01:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}原需求和十一票都保留。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.45,0:01:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}去哔哩哔哩Toy或百宝箱试一局。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.65,0:01:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}你会先升级银行，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.40,0:01:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}还是先出兵？
